{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["Before the year of famine came — And since Jacob came at the beginning of the famine years, in the second year, and at the end of seventeen years at the time of his death he said to Joseph: שני בניך הנולדים לך עד באי אליך לי הם, but מולדתך אשר הולדת אחריהם אחרי באי אליך לך יהיו — therefore he explained here that Ephraim and Manasseh were born before the famine years, before Jacob came; but afterward he begot sons and grandsons who were named after their brothers in their inheritance, as Jacob said."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:01.640022934Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}